  64:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_rfft_q15.c **** * \par
  65:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_rfft_q15.c **** * Internally input is downscaled by 2 for every stage to avoid saturations inside CFFT/CIFFT proces
  66:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_rfft_q15.c **** * Hence the output format is different for different RFFT sizes.
  67:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_rfft_q15.c **** * The input and output formats for different RFFT sizes and number of bits to upscale are mentioned
  68:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_rfft_q15.c **** * \par
  69:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/TransformFunctions/arm_rfft_q15.c **** * \image html RFFTQ15.gif "Input and Output Formats for Q15 RFFT"
